Breaks: a conditional grant does not mark its catalog's document, so on MongoDB two grants made at once write nothing in common, never conflict, and each passes on a snapshot that misses the other.
Module: catalog-store-mongo
Test: MongoStoreSuiteTest$Grants#racingConditionalPutsSeeEachOther

